cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "circular-food-graphrag: an experiment-oriented GraphRAG pipeline with ontology-grounded evaluation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Lazzarotto"
    given-names: "Francesco"
  - family-names: "Coucourde"
    given-names: "Giulia"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FrancescoLazzarotto/circular-food-graphrag"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - GraphRAG
  - knowledge graph
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - circular economy
  - food systems
  - LLM evaluation
abstract: >-
  End-to-end GraphRAG codebase: knowledge-graph construction from PDF corpora
  into Neo4j (GLiNER NER, LLM triple extraction, cross-lingual entity
  resolution), multi-strategy graph+text retrieval with LLM generation, and a
  full evaluation toolkit (retrieval metrics, text metrics, RAGAS,
  LLM-as-a-judge with bootstrap confidence intervals). Applied to a bilingual
  Italian/English corpus on the circular economy of food.
